{"q":"64","t":"Minimum Path Sum","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a <code>m x n</code> <code>grid</code> filled with non-negative numbers, find a path from top left to bottom right, which minimizes the sum of all numbers along its path.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> You can only move either down or right at any point in time.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/7dc5d097a117cd0a.jpg\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 242px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> grid = [[1,3,1],[1,5,1],[4,2,1]]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 7\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> Because the path 1 &rarr; 3 &rarr; 1 &rarr; 1 &rarr; 1 minimizes the sum.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> grid = [[1,2,3],[4,5,6]]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 12\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>m == grid.length</code></li>\n\t<li><code>n == grid[i].length</code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= m, n &lt;= 200</code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= grid[i][j] &lt;= 200</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"minPathSum\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"grid\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[][]\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"},{"name":"Matrix","slug":"matrix"}],"s":[{"t":"Unique Paths","s":"unique-paths","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Dungeon Game","s":"dungeon-game","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Cherry Pickup","s":"cherry-pickup","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Minimum Path Cost in a Grid","s":"minimum-path-cost-in-a-grid","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Maximum Number of Points with Cost","s":"maximum-number-of-points-with-cost","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Minimum Cost Homecoming of a Robot in a Grid","s":"minimum-cost-homecoming-of-a-robot-in-a-grid","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Paths in Matrix Whose Sum Is Divisible by K","s":"paths-in-matrix-whose-sum-is-divisible-by-k","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Check if There is a Path With Equal Number of 0's And 1's","s":"check-if-there-is-a-path-with-equal-number-of-0s-and-1s","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Minimum Cost of a Path With Special Roads","s":"minimum-cost-of-a-path-with-special-roads","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Meta","facebook"],["Infosys","infosys"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Uber","uber"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Texas Instruments","texas-instruments"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Squarepoint Capital","squarepoint-capital"],["General Motors","general-motors"],["Waymo","waymo"]]}